NG CHU:  HAI TRIEU SAU TRAM BON MUOI BAY NGHIN DONG\n\nTHEO THONG BAO CUA CONG TY NGAY  01/08/2019\n\nTOI XAC NHAN RANG TREN CO SO KHI CONG TY THANH TOAN SO TIEN NEU TREN CHO NGUOI DUOC UY QUYEN, CONG\n\nTY DUOC:\n\n1) MIEN TRU KHOI MOI KHIEU NAI HAY YEU CAU BOI THUONG CUA TOI DOI VOI CONG TY VE KHOAN THANH TOAN NOI\n\nTREN.\n\n2) TOI BOI HOAN VA GIU CHO CONG TY KHONG PHAI CHI TRA BAT KY KHOAN TIEN GI DOI VOI TAT CA CAC YEU CAU,\n\nKHIEU NAI, NGHIA VU NO, TON THAT, CHI PHI PHAT SINH LIEN QUAN DEN HAY DO VIEC CONG TY THANH TOAN\n\nKHOAN TIEN NAY CHO NGUOI DUOC UY QUYEN NEU TREN.\n\nGIAY UY QUYEN NAY CHI CO HIEU LUC TRONG VONG BA (03) THANG KE TU NGAY KY VA CO GIA TRI RANG BUOC DOI VOI\n\nNHUNG NGUOI DAI DIEN CUA CA NHAN TOI, NHUNG NGUOI THUA KE VA/ HOAC QUAN LY DI SAN CUA TOI.\n\nBEN MUA BAO  CHUYEN VIEN TU VAN BAO HIEM DUOC UY  NGUOI LAM  XAC NHAN CUA\n\nHIEM  QUYEN  CHUNG  ADM\n\n(KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)\n\nCONG TY CHI CHI TRA SAU KHI DOI CHIEU CHU KY VOI HO SO YEU CAU BAO HIEM\n\nMOI SUA CHUA TREN GIAY UY QUYEN PHAI CO CHU KY XAC NHAN CUA BEN UY QUYEN\n\nPOSF6105", "html": "<p>SO 108 CHUA BOC, HIEP BINH CHANH, THU DUC,</p>\n<p>TPHCM</p>\n<p>Tel: 0687290991</p>\n<p>www.congtycpbaohiemnha.vn</p>\n<p>CONG TY CP BAO HIEM NHAN THO DAI TIN PHONG DICH VU KHACH HANG</p>\n<h1>GIAY UY QUYEN NHAN TIEN</h1>\n<h2>(CHI AP DUNG CHO TRUONG HOP UY QUYEN CHO CHUYEN VIEN TU VAN BAO HIEM NHAN PHI BAO HIEM HOAN LAI VOI SO TIEN NHO HON</h2>\n<h2>5.000.000 DONG)</h2>\n<p>HO VA TEN (CHU IN HOA) DUONG HAI NAM</p>\n<p>SO CMND 887598027</p>\n<p>NGAY CAP 22/02/2008</p>\n<p>NOI CAP THUA THIEN HUE</p>\n<p>LA BEN MUA BAO HIEM CUA HOP DONG BAO HIEM/HO SO YEU CAU BAO HIEM SO: 45948332</p>\n<p>HO VA TEN (CHU IN HOA) NGO THI HONG NHUNG</p>\n<p>SO CMND 739142622</p>\n<p>NGAY CAP 21/03/2017</p>\n<p>NOI CAP TPHCM</p>\n<p>DIA CHI PHUONG 25 - BINH THANH - TPHCM</p>\n<p>MA SO TU VAN 18178267</p>\n<p>DIEN THOAI 0954115506</p>\n<p>BANG SO: 2